{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13521","headline":"寄韦子春 · 王季友","name":"寄韦子春","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"出山秋云曙，山木已再春。\n食我山中药，不忆山中人。\n山中谁余密，白发日相亲。\n雀鼠画夜无，知我厨廪贫。\n依依北舍松，不厌吾南隣。\n有情尽弃捐，土石爲同身。\n夫子质千寻，天泽枝叶新。\n余以不材寿，非智免斧斤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王季友","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13521.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13521","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}